<title>UK: TENNIS-UNFINISHED MATCHES AT WIMBLEDON.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-UNFINISHED MATCHES AT WIMBLEDON.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unfinished first round matches at</p>
<p>Wimbledon on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding)</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>Danny Sapsford (Britain) level with Nicolas Pereira</p>
<p>(Venezuela) 3-6 6-2 3-3</p>
<p>Adrian Voinea (Romania) level with  Alexander Radulescu</p>
<p>(Germany) 6-7 6-3 1-6 6-3 3-3</p>
<p>Sargis Sargsian (Armenia) leads Johan Van Herck (Belgium) 7-6</p>
<p>6-2 3-3</p>
<p>Jan Siemerink (Netherlands) leads Renzo Furlan (Italy) 7-6</p>
<p>7-6 4-6 4-6 2-1</p>
<p>Michael Tebbutt (Australia) leads Javier Sanchez (Spain) 6-3</p>
<p>6-4 4-6 3-3</p>
<p>Jeff Salzenstein (U.S.) leads Patrick Baur (Germany) 6-7 6-3</p>
<p>6-3 2-2</p>
<p>Women's singles</p>
<p>Maria Alejandra Vento (Venezuela) leads Annabel Ellwood</p>
<p>(Australia) 7-5 2-0</p>
<p>Ginger Helgeson Nielsen (U.S.) leads Lucie Ahl (Britain) 6-2</p>
<p>4-2</p>
</text>
